    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$newhope01_intro",
        "key": "$newhope01_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 1,
        "delay": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_135_halo_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dorothy... Dorothy! Are you okay?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, I'm fine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy"
    },
    {
        "text": "S-Slow down. You almost knocked me over...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_135_halo_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's all my fault. If I'd found out what Ferdinand's been up to sooner... If I'd figured out a way to tell everyone sooner... If I'd talked to you a little more... If...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sheesh, look at you... You came all the way here from observation in a hurry. There's dirt on your face.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_135_halo_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It might've gotten on my face when I was beating up Ferdinand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_135_halo_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I already forgot what I grabbed to beat him with... My hand was shaking really bad.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Were you taking it out on him?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_135_halo_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No... That didn't feel good at all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_135_halo_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dorothy, I'm disappointed, and I'm angry, but after the dust settled, and after seeing those soldiers run after him... I also started to feel really bad.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Because of everything Ferdinand did?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_135_halo_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, because... because of what he could've done.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_135_halo_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I still remember everything he taught me, and I still believe that, when he told me about his grand ideas, there wasn't an inkling of deception behind the light in his eyes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_135_halo_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And... there was a time... when I wanted his recognition more than anything...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_135_halo_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's gotta be really silly, right? Saying stuff like that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not even a little, Elena.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sometimes... It's harder to accept than to deny.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You won't have to be anyone's assistant ever again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "He won't cast his shadow on you again, but the flames he lit still burn in your eyes. His end is your start point, and there's no doubt you will walk much farther than he ever did.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_135_halo_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dorothy...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_135_halo_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why do you sound like you're saying goodbye? What do you mean I won't be an assistant anymore...? I know you plugged yourself into the 'Hub,' but that doesn't mean there's something wrong with your body, right?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Calm down...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm fine. If you don't believe me, ask our good doctor...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_108_silent_1#10$1",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I make no guarantees.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Olivia, are you finished checking all the Pioneers?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_108_silent_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's still one more to go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_108_silent_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The 'Transmitter' is still flowing through you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_108_silent_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You are showing no physical abnormalities at the moment, but no one can tell how things might develop in the future.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You don't need to worry about me, my dear doctor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "These substances flowing inside me pose no greater threat than the crystals on your bodies... and the brewing storm up ahead.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4048_doroth_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But those little things won't stop us, will they?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dorothy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_108_silent_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Certainly not.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "The out-of-control construct caused significant destruction to the base."
    },
    {
        "text": "There is hardly any rubble in front of them; only a clean floor of silvery white."
    },
    {
        "text": "Before long, even that will be cleaned up."
    },
    {
        "text": "But... there will always be traces left here."
    },
    {
        "text": "Suddenly, the silver river in front of them begins to move again."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_108_silent_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_108_silent_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The reflection of the rainclouds, huh...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
