    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Saria stops in her tracks and looks up."
    },
    {
        "text": "There are rainclouds slowly drifting their way into the city."
    },
    {
        "text": "At the test site some sixty miles away..."
    },
    {
        "text": "Somebody else is thinking the exact same thing."
    },
    {
        "text": "It's about to rain in Trimounts.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silence & Saria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "image"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "29_g1_outdoorbase",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_535_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's pretty much a wrap.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_535_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thanks for helping us clean up, Greyy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1027_greyy2_1#9$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm glad I could help, Mr. Sonny.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greyy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1027_greyy2_1#9$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "And uh... there's not actually much to clean.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greyy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_535_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We did good. Looks just like how things were when we got here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_535_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, do me a favor and pass on our apology and some thanks to your coworkers. It's just like you said. You Rhodes Islanders pulled us up out of our funk.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1027_greyy2_1#9$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, Mr. Sonny. It was you and the rest of the Pioneers who saved yourselves.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greyy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1027_greyy2_1#9$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you forget? If you hadn't made your 'voice' heard, we wouldn't have had the chance to take your hand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greyy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_535_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm blessed to have a friend like you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_535_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "My little engineer buddy, I'll never forget what you told me, not to mention everything that happened here at the site.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_535_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And Mary...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_527_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's my job to make sure all of you get away from the site.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_535_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What I was gonna say is... you still got a chance to arrest me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_527_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "This whole mess is an experiment gone wrong, thanks to the work of a lone actor\u2014That's the word from on high anyway.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_527_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And since those Rhine researchers don't want to press charges, your little 'kidnapping' isn't in the records.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_535_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, I'm not talking about the last couple days.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_535_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm talking about... four years ago.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_535_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you know why I signed up for the experiment that night?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_535_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Every Pioneer has a reason to wanna go back to the city, and my reason is...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_535_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have to go back to someone I hurt bad\u2014Someone who used to be my dearest friend.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_535_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I owe her an apology, and\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_535_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I deserve to be judged.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_535_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've been on the run for four years. At first, I thought the wastes swallowed my dreams, and changed me into a different man...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_535_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But that's not what happened.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_535_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "On that night four years ago, I killed the Sonny Romano who believed in justice and equality. I did it with my own two hands.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_527_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_527_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you do get arrested, there's only two possible punishments waiting for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_527_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "One, you'll get thrown in prison and then the Infected quarantine zone once you've done your time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_527_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And the other...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_527_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You be a Pioneer, and the nomadic cities will be closed to you forever.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_535_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_527_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But you're already a Pioneer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_535_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "So that means you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_527_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's stop it with all this talk about whether I forgive you or not. Your old buddy is here to send you on your way. Shouldn't you hurry up and do something more meaningful?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "A long overdue, warm hug."
    },
    {
        "text": "A true reunion, and also a formal farewell after years apart."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_527_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Have you figured out where to go next?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_535_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's some guy who's got a bunch of letters for a name. Starts with a D. He sent us all a kinda weird email the other day, and there was an invitation to work with him attached.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_535_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I still have no idea how he got the contact information for the Pioneer Team... He doesn't seem like he's from a recruiting agency.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_527_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You should be more careful the next time you pick up work...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_527_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Try not to break the law again either. Otherwise, it doesn't matter where you run. I'll drag you back here. I promise.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_535_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Haha...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_535_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You got it, Officer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sonny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not far away, his brothers and sisters on the Pioneer Team call out to him."
    },
    {
        "text": "Sonny knows that, this time, he's truly prepared to go on his journey."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "29_g2_edgeofbase",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_249_muesys_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "They started cleaning up the mess at the test site.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_249_muesys_1#5",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "It was your Energy Director who made the mess anyway...;Rhine Lab's still in charge of cleanup.",
        "values": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_249_muesys_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah... I guess this is a kinda corporate social responsibility for us, huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_249_muesys_1#1",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "I'm more willing to believe this is a deal.;......;On the essence of what you just said, I agree.",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_249_muesys_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, not like there's anyone who believes that explanation here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_249_muesys_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Those Pioneers...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_249_muesys_1#4",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "You've been watching them for a while.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_249_muesys_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "They're starting a new journey.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_249_muesys_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "I wonder... what they'll find next time?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_249_muesys_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Again and again in a never-ending cycle.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_249_muesys_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "They can never go back home, and they might never again have a place they can even call home.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_521_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor, I found that the Rhine personnel are digging away in the rubble of the labs...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mechanist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_521_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Director Muelsyse, you're here too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mechanist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_249_muesys_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_249_muesys_1#5",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Muelsyse...",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Have you figured out when you'll answer my question yet?",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_249_muesys_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Question... What is it that's bothering me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_249_muesys_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "When I'm prepared to talk...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_249_muesys_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You'll be the first to know, Dr. {@nickname}.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Muelsyse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 3
    },
