    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_536_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Relax... It's all been taken care of. No civilians will ever find out what happened at Site 359, and there is no chance of anyone using this against you in your upcoming election.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ho'olheyak"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_536_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, I'm well out of Trimounts already, on my way to Max D.C. now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ho'olheyak"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_536_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ferdinand...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ho'olheyak"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_536_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "He's no threat anymore. You can be sure of that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ho'olheyak"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$transmission",
        "volume": 0.9
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_399_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ma'am... Y-You're standing right outside Rhine Lab. Why did you lie to the vice president?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Columbian Mercenary"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_536_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Because...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ho'olheyak"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_536_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I still remember my original goal.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ho'olheyak"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "27_g26_dusk_wild",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$drift_intro",
        "key": "$drift_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 1,
        "delay": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_mechawalk",
        "volume": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "He doesn't know how far he's walked."
    },
    {
        "text": "His aching, hoarse throat reminds him that his body cannot bear such exhaustion."
    },
    {
        "text": "However... It feels as though Trimounts is right behind him."
    },
    {
        "text": "It could be right in front of him too."
    },
    {
        "text": "The shadow of a nomadic city is enormous, and it grows endlessly with the passage of time."
    },
    {
        "text": "He must hurry... hurry..."
    },
    {
        "text": "Where is he going in such a hurry? Will someone betray him at the next waypoint, just as Elena and Ho'olheyak did?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hold it there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pioneer Team Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Quiet Power Armor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We know who you are.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pioneer Team Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ferdinand... You think you get to just walk away scot-free after everything you've done?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pioneer Team Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Quiet Power Armor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't think that gear you're in is going to scare us. You talk big, but you can't actually control it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pioneer Team Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even if you open fire and kill us all here...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pioneer Team Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You'll run into the next team of Pioneers.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pioneer Team Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_534_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Look out into the wastes! No friends here! Your enemies go on forever!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pioneer Team Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Quiet Power Armor"
    },
    {
        "text": "It doesn't matter."
    },
    {
        "text": "The 'Transmitter' he developed himself is right at his fingertips. All he has to do is inject it into himself, and he will immediately be able to wield this power armor with ease, and all these so-called enemies will be powerless against him."
    },
    {
        "text": "But why doesn't he do it?"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is it because he doesn't have the courage that Dorothy does?"
    },
    {
        "text": "Or is it because..."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Ferdinand, you are the one who's being left behind by the times\u2014the grand ideals in your eyes."
    },
    {
        "text": "Because you never believed that you belong to this epoch."
    },
    {
        "text": "You always talk about how you're in control of it, you're always thinking, controlling... but you never feel."
    },
    {
        "text": "Whose voice is this? Is it... Elena's?"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right, if you don't want to be left behind... you must become a part of it."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "27_g26_dusk_wild",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Quiet Power Armor"
    },
    {
        "text": "The power armor remains silent. It proceeds no further, and it does not put up a struggle."
    },
    {
        "text": "It simply raises its arms..."
    },
    {
        "text": "Just like it is embracing the winds, the sunlight, and the lands before it."
    },
    {
        "text": "An onslaught of angry Pioneers rushes toward it, and just as the silver monster that once hovered midair above the test site\u2014swallows the iron-forged body whole."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "29_g10_senioroffice",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$darkness01_intro",
        "key": "$darkness01_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 1,
        "delay": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_537_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Does the Maylander Foundation still have doubts about this?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kristen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, Control.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not representing Maylander this time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_537_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm a busy woman, you know...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kristen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right. It so happens I prefer to skip the pleasantries.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "You retrieved the most crucial part of the experiment at Site 359.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "The 'Hub' was destroyed in its entirety, by Dorothy\u2014That's what it says in the report submitted to the government.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "But it so happens that I saw a team in some pretty low-key outfits driving a discreet, completely curtained off transport into your personal laboratory.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "Saria said you turned a blind eye to what Ferdinand was doing... Perhaps it would be more accurate to say you used him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "The thing that you wanted most is now sitting right on your desk.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_537_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The cleanup work at Site 359 is a project that Rhine Lab had to take.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kristen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_537_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And every day, countless failed experiments' byproducts are destroyed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kristen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_537_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No matter what it is you think you saw, it's not worthy of outside attention.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kristen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Destroyed? Well, of course. I'm sure that scrap heap is gone from your desk.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "Evidence can be destroyed, and memories can be modified, but whenever something happens, it tends to have a lasting effect on the things that come after.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "Loken, Parvis, Ferdinand... Maybe, at some point in the future, their names will be completely absent from the history books.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "But there is no doubt they changed the course of history.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "Arts Unit implants, technologies imbued with revived ancient Sarkaz powers, power armor controllable over a long distance, and mental manifestation networks over even broader areas...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "What will be the next experiment that alters the very epoch we live in?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_537_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "A researcher is here to explore all the possibilities out there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kristen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_537_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't make predictions.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kristen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Suppose that memories can leap past the limitations of time. Predictions are nothing more than rediscovering history that's been buried.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_536_1#3$1",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Why don't we reacquaint ourselves, Kristen Wright?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ho'olheyak"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_536_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm Ho'olheyak, historian and Honorary President of the Columbian Astrological Research Association.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ho'olheyak"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_536_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And forgive me for making a prediction right here and now\u2014",
